{:edb/db-before-t 562 :edb/db-after-t 563 :edb/tx-data [[13194139533875 50 #inst "2026-10-05T06:40:30.369Z" 13194139533875 true] [17592186087768 1020 #edb/ref 17592186262861 13194139533875 true] [17592186087769 1020 #edb/ref 17592186262854 13194139533875 true] [17592186087769 1020 #edb/ref 17592186262868 13194139533875 true] [17592186087769 1020 #edb/ref 17592186262875 13194139533875 true] [17592186088023 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533875 true] [17592186088023 1145 "First, we write the equation in standard form by bringing all of the terms to the left-hand side. This gives the equation\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}-2x+50=0.\n$$\n\nWe can find the roots of a quadratic equation using the quadratic formula:\n\n$$\nx=\\frac{-b\\pm \\sqrt{{b}^{2}-4ac}}{2a}\n$$\n\nIn this case, the coefficients are $a=1,\\,b=-2,$ and $c=50.$ Substituting these values into the quadratic formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =\\frac{-(-2)\\pm \\sqrt{(-2)^{2}-4(1)(50)}}{2(1)} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\pm \\sqrt{4-200}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\pm \\sqrt{-196}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\pm 14\\,\\text{i}}{2} \\\\  & =1\\pm 7\\,\\text{i}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation has two solutions, $x=1+7\\,\\text{i}$ and $x=1-7\\,\\text{i}.$" 13194139533875 true] [17592186262854 1017 #edb/ref 17592186262855 13194139533875 true] [17592186262854 1089 "q-113245" 13194139533875 true] [17592186262854 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533875 true] [17592186262854 1100 "The equation ${x}^{2}-6x+34=0$ can be written in the form $(x+p)^{2}=q.$ Find $p+q,$ and solve the equation." 13194139533875 true] [17592186262854 1113 #uuid "ed379096-4def-51e1-8cd6-e568b470e309" 13194139533875 true] [17592186262854 1145 "We first move the constant to the right-hand side:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}-6x+34 & =0 \\\\ {x}^{2}-6x & =-34\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we complete the square on the left-hand side:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}-6x & =-34 \\\\ {x}^{2}-2\\cdot 3x+{3}^{2}-{3}^{2} & =-34 \\\\ (x-3)^{2}-9 & =-34 \\\\ (x-3)^{2} & =-25\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $p=-3,\\,q=-25,$ and $p+q=-28.$\n\nFinally, we solve the equation using the square root method:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-3)^{2} & =-25 \\\\ x-3 & =\\pm \\sqrt{-25} \\\\ x-3 & =\\pm 5\\,\\text{i} \\\\ x & =3\\pm 5\\,\\text{i}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation has two solutions, $x=3+5\\,\\text{i}$ and $x=3-5\\,\\text{i}.$" 13194139533875 true] [17592186262855 1000 #edb/ref 17592186262856 13194139533875 true] [17592186262855 1000 #edb/ref 17592186262857 13194139533875 true] [17592186262855 1000 #edb/ref 17592186262858 13194139533875 true] [17592186262855 1000 #edb/ref 17592186262859 13194139533875 true] [17592186262855 1000 #edb/ref 17592186262860 13194139533875 true] [17592186262855 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533875 true] [17592186262855 1041 "selection" 13194139533875 true] [17592186262855 1104 #edb/ref 17592186262856 13194139533875 true] [17592186262855 1110 #uuid "835d29e0-8e70-5cbf-a186-51ba6e696c1e" 13194139533875 true] [17592186262856 1034 "p+q=-28,\\,x=3\\pm 5\\,\\text{i}" 13194139533875 true] [17592186262856 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533875 true] [17592186262856 1111 #uuid "ec31137e-54bd-5fae-a80a-ec5cc7564743" 13194139533875 true] [17592186262857 1034 "p+q=22,\\,x=3\\pm 5\\,\\text{i}" 13194139533875 true] [17592186262857 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533875 true] [17592186262857 1111 #uuid "5ab819f1-b137-5387-ba0e-b180c9c1d7ae" 13194139533875 true] [17592186262858 1034 "p+q=-28,\\,x=5\\pm 3\\,\\text{i}" 13194139533875 true] [17592186262858 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533875 true] [17592186262858 1111 #uuid "a5d13c9a-48d1-53f6-9cae-598b61d7a27a" 13194139533875 true] [17592186262859 1034 "p+q=22,\\,x=5\\pm 3\\,\\text{i}" 13194139533875 true] [17592186262859 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533875 true] [17592186262859 1111 #uuid "793b92be-55a7-56d9-b512-1e28798469d1" 13194139533875 true] [17592186262860 1034 "p+q=-28,\\,x=3\\pm 3\\,\\text{i}" 13194139533875 tru